const express=require("express"),router=express.Router(),upload=require("../utilities/multer"),cloudinary=require("../utilities/cloudinary"),tinify=require("tinify"),compressImage=(require("dotenv").config(),tinify.key=process.env.TINIFY_KEY,function(e,r,i){tinify.fromFile(e.file.path).toFile(e.file.path,function(){i()})});router.post("/upload-single",upload.single("image"),compressImage,async(e,r)=>{e.file?(e=await cloudinary.uploader.upload(e.file.path),r.status(200).send(e)):r.send({code:422,msg:"field_required"})}),router.post("/upload-video",upload.single("file"),async(e,r)=>{if(!e.file)return r.status(422).send({code:422,msg:"field_required"});try{var i=await cloudinary.uploader.upload(e.file.path,{resource_type:"video"});r.status(200).send(i)}catch(e){r.status(500).send({code:500,msg:"upload_error",error:e.message})}}),module.exports=router;